      "filename": "Genoese Palace in Galata Istanbul 3.jpg",
      "title": "File:Genoese Palace in Galata Istanbul 3.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/Genoese_Palace_in_Galata_Istanbul_3.jpg",
